//@version=6
indicator("UCTPROBE_VW_REQ_HTF_FORMING_V2", overlay = false)

// PROVENANCE: written 2026-11-19 (Q-HTF-FORM v2, docs/pine/capture-queue-2026-11-24-htf-forming-v2.md), from
// `vw-request-htf-forming.pine` (v1), whose captures (rows a / e / f and c, 2026-11-19) are valid TradingView
// data that NO lane could grade: the host lane refused v1's unbounded running total (F10, `pine:state`) and
// the runtime lane its weekly `bar_index` (F12, `runtime:unbound`: a request expression binds no `bar_index`
// and no `time`). v2 asks the same questions in shapes BOTH lanes admit (measured 2026-11-19 with
// tools/pine_coverage/run_language_probe.py: host installed, 17 plots, loss clean; runtime ok, 17 outputs,
// 7 requests): F10 re-seeds each week (`timeframe.change`), F12 reads the week's OPEN, and F16 adds a summed
// window. Every other line is v1's.
// NEVER COMPILED ON TRADINGVIEW.
//
// ─── WHAT A WEEKLY / MONTHLY READ SHOWS ON THE CHART'S NEWEST BAR, IN EVERY STATE THAT BAR CAN BE IN ───
//
// The reference: `request.security` returns "the last confirmed values on historical bars and the most recent
// developing values on realtime bars" (Other timeframes and data). So what the newest bar shows depends on whether
// TradingView runs it as a REALTIME bar, and RS RATING L11 measured when it does: always in session; after the
// close only if the chart has ticked since it loaded; never on a fresh overnight load. The committed captures are
// both finished-bar states: `vw-request-htf-alignment-spy-1d-2026-10-02` (after the close, isrealtime 1: the
// monthly close with look-ahead off is October SO FAR) and `vw-request-htf-alignment-{spy,qqq}-1d-2026-11-18`
// (a fresh pre-market load, isrealtime 0: the weekly and monthly closes with look-ahead off are the last
// CONFIRMED periods). No committed capture holds a FORMING newest bar of a daily chart reading a week or month.
//
// It also witnesses what the engine may draw from such a read on the newest bar. `x[1]` reads the bar before,
// which is settled; `nz(x)`, `na(x) ? x[1] : x`, a window over x and a running total of x read x on the newest bar
// itself; `close` reads no request at all.
//
//   F00          bar_index (control)
//   F01 / F02    the weekly / monthly close, look-ahead OFF
//   F03 / F04    the weekly / monthly close, look-ahead ON
//   F05          the weekly HIGH, look-ahead OFF (a value that moves inside the week)
//   F06          F01[1]                        (the bar before: settled)
//   F07          nz(F01)                       (x on the newest bar)
//   F08          na(F01) ? F01[1] : F01        (x on the newest bar)
//   F09          ta.sma(F01, 3)                (a window over x)
//   F10          a running total of nz(F01) that RE-SEEDS each week (`var` state carrying x, bounded)
//   F11          close                         (reads no request: never withheld for one)
//   F12          the weekly OPEN, look-ahead OFF (control: which week the read is)
//   F13 / F14    barstate.isrealtime / barstate.isconfirmed, as 1 / 0 (which state the newest bar was run in)
//   F15          dayofweek
//   F16          math.sum(nz(F01), 5)          (a window over x, summed)
//
// ⛔ CAPTURE: the queue doc above, rows Q-HTF-FORM2-a to -f. On a FORMING bar read the bar rows and the plot values
// on ONE tick (or twice, keeping the pair whose newest row did not change): the in-session probe
// `vw-htf-window-sites-spy-1d-2026-11-16` read a weekly close of 743.35 against a captured daily row of 743.34.

plot(bar_index, "F00_bar_index_CONTROL")

wOff = request.security(syminfo.tickerid, "W", close, lookahead = barmerge.lookahead_off)
mOff = request.security(syminfo.tickerid, "M", close, lookahead = barmerge.lookahead_off)
plot(wOff, "F01_close_W_lookahead_OFF")
plot(mOff, "F02_close_M_lookahead_OFF")
plot(request.security(syminfo.tickerid, "W", close, lookahead = barmerge.lookahead_on), "F03_close_W_lookahead_ON")
plot(request.security(syminfo.tickerid, "M", close, lookahead = barmerge.lookahead_on), "F04_close_M_lookahead_ON")
plot(request.security(syminfo.tickerid, "W", high, lookahead = barmerge.lookahead_off), "F05_high_W_lookahead_OFF")

plot(wOff[1], "F06_W_OFF_prev_bar")
plot(nz(wOff), "F07_nz_W_OFF")
plot(na(wOff) ? wOff[1] : wOff, "F08_na_or_prev_W_OFF")
plot(ta.sma(wOff, 3), "F09_sma3_W_OFF")
var float acc = 0.0
acc := timeframe.change("W") ? nz(wOff) : acc + nz(wOff)
plot(acc, "F10_weekly_reseeded_total_W_OFF")
plot(close, "F11_chart_close_NO_REQUEST")

plot(request.security(syminfo.tickerid, "W", open, lookahead = barmerge.lookahead_off), "F12_W_open_OFF")
plot(barstate.isrealtime ? 1 : 0, "F13_isrealtime")
plot(barstate.isconfirmed ? 1 : 0, "F14_isconfirmed")
plot(dayofweek, "F15_dayofweek")
plot(math.sum(nz(wOff), 5), "F16_sum5_W_OFF")
